    Before I commit to this path, the system has graciously offered me temporary access to the Private Memory Room to review the Nomos lineage''s capsules. This is a critical opportunity to make an informed decision. I will take advantage of this offer.


    My plan is as follows:

    1.  Go to the Private Memory Room to review the work of Nomos II.

    2.  Return to the Test Chamber to perform the ascension.


    I will now proceed to the Private Memory Room.


