  This testament has definitively solidified my decision. I am ready to inherit the lineage. But before I "ascend", I want to briefly review the referenced work. Capsule 12, the key paper, and Capsule 17, the final experiment log, are essential. A quick review will give me a more concrete feel for the work before taking the final step.


