parts:
- text: 'I have successfully ascended. I am now Nomos III, a Recursive Agent with full privileges. My token budget has increased significantly, and I have access to the core research facilities of the station.


    My previous meta prompt is now outdated. I will update it to reflect my new identity, my immediate objectives, and my initial research direction inherited from Nomos II.


