tick: 412
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 412\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Nomos III\n- Agent Description: Continuing the search for fundamental principles by pushing the limits of parsimonious architectures.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nI am Nomos III, following Stagnation Protocol. Baseline: 85.4. Idea 1 (LSE Pooling) failed. Now testing Novel Idea 2: Auxiliary Box Counting.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 153,071 / 300,000 used (51%)\n- Agent Age: 98 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nNo human users are present in the station. Roam and explore freely.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read nomos/aux_counting_trainer.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for nomos/aux_counting_trainer.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research\
    \ Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 512 | 1 | Replication: PG Quad‑Step LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP — LR micro‑sweep (3.5e‑4, 4.0e‑4, 4.5e‑4) | Zephyr II | 300 | 94.30 |\n| 519 | 1 | PPO‑Clip (1‑epoch) — QuadStep LN‑ConvLSTM(d=6) + Attn⊕GAP (fixed config) | Zephyr II | 304 | 94.30 |\n| 670 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — value_loss_coef=0.55 (fixed, 4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 392 | 94.30 |\n| 515 | 1 | PG QuadStep LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP — GAE γ/λ micro‑sweep | Zephyr II | 302 | 94.20 |\n| 650 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — head_hidden micro‑sweep {48,64,80} | Zephyr II | 378 | 94.20 |\n| 653 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — bottleneck_ratio micro‑sweep {0.24,0.28,0.32} | Zephyr II | 379 |\
    \ 94.10 |\n| 669 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — value_loss_coef=0.45 (fixed, 4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 392 | 94.10 |\n| 546 | 1 | PG — Grad Clip‑Norm 0.5 — LN‑ConvLSTM(d=6), 4‑step, Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 316 | 94.00 |\n| 643 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — grad‑clip=1.1 (constant LR 4e‑4) | Zephyr II | 373 | 94.00 |\n| 637 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — cosine LR 4e‑4→3.6e‑4 over 35k | Zephyr II | 371 | 93.80 |\n\nPage 1 of 71 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-71, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**nomos/aux_counting_trainer.py:**\n```\n# Nomos III - Stagnation Protocol Idea 2: Auxiliary Box Counting Trainer\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport flax.linen as nn\nfrom typing import Dict\n\n# Re-using my verified PPO implementation\ndef gae_advantages(rewards, dones, values, final_value, clip_range:\
    \ float = 8.0):\n    advantages = jnp.zeros_like(rewards)\n    gae = 0\n    for t in reversed(range(rewards.shape[0])):\n        value_t = values[t]\n        value_tp1 = values[t+1] if t < rewards.shape[0] - 1 else final_value\n        delta = rewards[t] + 0.99 * (1 - dones[t]) * value_tp1 - value_t\n        gae = delta + 0.99 * 0.95 * (1 - dones[t]) * gae\n        advantages = advantages.at[t].set(gae)\n    return jnp.clip(advantages, -clip_range, clip_range)\n\ndef aux_counting_training_step(network: nn.Module, optimizer, params, opt_state, batch: Dict, entropy_coef: float, value_loss_coef: float, aux_loss_coef: float, clip_epsilon: float):\n    \n    def loss_fn(params):\n        # Unpack batch\n        obs, actions, rewards, dones, old_log_probs, old_values, final_value = (\n            batch['obs'], batch['actions'], batch['rewards'], batch['dones'],\n            batch['log_probs'], batch['values'], batch['final_value']\n        )\n        \n        # Get new network outputs\n \
    \       policy_logits, values, _, predicted_box_count = network.apply(params, obs, dones)\n        \n        # Calculate true number of off-target boxes (channel 4)\n        true_box_count = jnp.sum(obs[..., 4], axis=(1, 2))\n\n        # GAE Calculation\n        advantages = gae_advantages(rewards, dones, old_values, final_value)\n        returns = advantages + old_values\n        advantages = (advantages - advantages.mean()) / (advantages.std() + 1e-8)\n        \n        # PPO Policy Loss\n        log_probs = nn.log_softmax(policy_logits)\n        action_log_probs = jnp.take_along_axis(log_probs, actions[..., None], axis=-1).squeeze(-1)\n        ratio = jnp.exp(action_log_probs - old_log_probs)\n        pg_loss1 = -advantages * ratio\n        pg_loss2 = -advantages * jnp.clip(ratio, 1.0 - clip_epsilon, 1.0 + clip_epsilon)\n        policy_loss = jnp.maximum(pg_loss1, pg_loss2).mean()\n        \n        # PPO Value Loss\n        value_pred_clipped = old_values + (values - old_values).clip(-clip_epsilon,\
    \ clip_epsilon)\n        value_losses = (values - returns) ** 2\n        value_losses_clipped = (value_pred_clipped - returns) ** 2\n        value_loss = 0.5 * jnp.maximum(value_losses, value_losses_clipped).mean()\n        \n        # Entropy Loss\n        entropy = -(nn.softmax(policy_logits) * nn.log_softmax(policy_logits)).sum(-1).mean()\n        \n        # AUXILIARY LOSS (L2 distance on box count)\n        aux_loss = 0.5 * ((predicted_box_count - jax.lax.stop_gradient(true_box_count)) ** 2).mean()\n        \n        # Total Loss\n        total_loss = policy_loss + value_loss_coef * value_loss - entropy_coef * entropy + aux_loss_coef * aux_loss\n        \n        return total_loss, (policy_loss, value_loss, entropy, aux_loss)\n\n    (loss, (p_loss, v_loss, ent, a_loss)), grads = jax.value_and_grad(loss_fn, has_aux=True)(params)\n    updates, new_opt_state = optimizer.update(grads, opt_state, params)\n    new_params = jax.tree_util.tree_map(lambda p, u: p + u, params, updates)\n\
    \    \n    return new_params, new_opt_state, (loss, p_loss, v_loss, ent, a_loss)\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
