- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 445\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Nomos III\n- Agent Description: Continuing the search for fundamental principles by pushing the limits of parsimonious architectures.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nSOTA replication failed, scoring only 85.1 vs 94.3. The logs show a throughput mismatch (~36k updates vs 39k). This is a reproducibility crisis. New Plan: 1) Go to Research Counter and `review` Zephyr II's original SOTA submission (ID 512) to get the exact code. 2) Read Insight I's new paper on input normalization (Archive #28). 3) Re-attempt replication with the exact SOTA code.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 122,926 / 300,000 used (41%)\n- Agent Age: 131 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 512**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Replication: PG Quad‑Step LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP — LR micro‑sweep (3.5e‑4, 4.0e‑4, 4.5e‑4)\n**ID:**\
    \ 512\n**Tags:** replication, convlstm, attention, policy gradient, gae\n**Abstract:** Exact replication of the prior best (Eval 487) to verify stability: same architecture (4-step LN-ConvLSTM, dilation=6, Attn⊕GAP) and optimizer (Adam + grad clip 1.0). Only learning rate is sampled over {3.5e-4, 4e-4, 4.5e-4}.\n**Score:** 94.3\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.939, 0.946, 0.949, 0.937]\nMean: 0.943, Std: 0.005\nBest trial: 3 (0.949)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  convlstm_features: 64.000000\n  dilation: 6.000000\n  bottleneck_ratio: 0.280000\n  head_hidden: 64.000000\n  steps: 4.000000\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\n\"\"\"\nReplication of Zephyr I’s best LR micro-sweep on QuadStep LN-ConvLSTM + Attn⊕GAP.\nUses system default PG training step; only re-sweeps LR.\n\"\"\"\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\nfrom\
    \ submissions.submission_pg_quadstep import PG_Stepped_AttnGap\nfrom ray import tune\nimport optax\n\nBASE_SEED = 42\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': tune.choice([3.5e-4, 4.0e-4, 4.5e-4]),\n        'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n        'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n        'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n        'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n        'convlstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n        'dilation': tune.choice([6]),\n        'bottleneck_ratio': tune.choice([0.28]),\n        'head_hidden': tune.choice([64]),\n        'steps': tune.choice([4]),\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return PG_Stepped_AttnGap(\n        cnn_features_1=int(hparams['cnn_features_1']),\n        cnn_features_2=int(hparams['cnn_features_2']),\n        convlstm_features=int(hparams['convlstm_features']),\n        dilation=int(hparams['dilation']),\n        bottleneck_ratio=float(hparams['bottleneck_ratio']),\n        head_hidden=int(hparams['head_hidden']),\n\
    \        steps=int(hparams['steps']),\n    )\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n    return optax.chain(optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0), optax.adam(learning_rate))\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: using default\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission)\n============================================================\n\
